{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the impact of replacing the image encoder from resnet50 to imagenet_vit_l in a multimodal multiprofile setup with avgpool aggregation and weighted fusion, mirroring the high-performing config_019. The validation accuracy of 0.6352 is slightly lower than the baseline (0.6390), suggesting the image encoder choice may not significantly affect performance. The relative contribution of the image encoder versus other design choices remains uncertain without further isolation."
}

